  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed200.html",
  "prefLabel": "Ed 203.02 Form, Appearance, and Number of Documents",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 203.02 Form, Appearance, and Number of Documents. All documents to be filed under this chapter shall:\n\n(a) Be legible and of the size 8-1/2”x11”, with a left margin of 1-1/2”;\n\n(b) Be produced using a font that is easily read and not smaller than 10 point;\n\n(c) Be printed on only one side of the page;\n\n(d) Contain the title of the proceeding and the docket number after it is assigned;\n\n(e) Be dated and signed in ink; and\n\n(f) State the title, if applicable, and address of the signer.\n\nSource. #8334-A, eff 4-23-05 (from Ed 207.02)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed200.html"
